      "source": "Convert the <a href=\"OllamaChatOptions.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.ai.ollama.api\"><code>OllamaChatOptions</code></a> object to a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> of key/value pairs.",
