      "source": "Returns a new <a href=\"../../model/tool/ToolCallingChatOptions.Builder.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.model.tool\"><code>ToolCallingChatOptions.Builder</code></a> initialized with the values of\nthis <a href=\"../../model/tool/ToolCallingChatOptions.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.model.tool\"><code>ToolCallingChatOptions</code></a>.\n\nNarrows the return type of <a href=\"../../chat/prompt/ChatOptions.html#mutate()\"><code>ChatOptions.mutate()</code></a> so generic tool calling\ncode can chain methods without casting.",
      "translation": "返回一个新的<a href=\"../../model/tool/ToolCallingChatOptions.Builder.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.model.tool\"><code>ToolCallingChatOptions.Builder</code></a>，该对象已初始化为当前此<a href=\"../../model/tool/ToolCallingChatOptions.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.model.tool\"><code>ToolCallingChatOptions</code></a>的值。\n\n将<a href=\"../../chat/prompt/ChatOptions.html#mutate()\"><code>ChatOptions.mutate()</code></a>的返回类型收窄，以便通用工具调用代码可以无需强制转换即可链式调用方法。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
